      "content": "I recommend requesting clear photographic evidence of the damage and the packaging before processing any refund. This evidence is crucial for your claim and helps distinguish genuine damage from potential misuse. If the claim is verified with good proof, process the refund promptly to maintain good customer relations and avoid further disputes.",
